𝗡𝗙𝗧 𝗣𝘂𝗺𝗽 𝗶𝘀 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗶𝘀𝘀𝘂𝗮𝗻𝗰𝗲 𝗿𝗮𝗶𝗹 𝗯𝗲𝘀𝗶𝗱𝗲 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗺𝗮𝗿𝗸𝗲𝘁𝗽𝗹𝗮𝗰𝗲

A marketplace answers one important question: where can an existing NFT be discovered, listed, and traded? But that leaves another question unanswered. How does new digital work enter circulation in the first place?

@AINFTcom presents NFT Pump as a TRON-native fair-launch venue designed around that missing stage. Instead of treating issuance as a separate process disconnected from the marketplace, the ecosystem creates a route for new collections to move from creation toward on-chain availability
